  "body": "Step into a lifestyle of comfort, convenience, and contemporary coastal charm with this beautifully crafted brand-new home. Set on approximately 324sqm of land with an approximately 160sqm floor area, the home offers four well-sized bedrooms and two elegant bathrooms, delivering the ideal balance of practicality and relaxed living.\r\n\r\nThe light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area forms the heart of the home, enhanced by impressive high-raked ceilings that create an airy sense of openness and natural light throughout. The sleek designer kitchen features quality appliances, stylish cabinetry, and a large island bench- an inviting space where family and friends can gather with ease. Large sliding doors connect seamlessly to the sunny kwila deck, extending the living outdoors and creating the perfect setting for summer entertaining, morning coffees, or quiet evenings in complete privacy.\r\n\r\nThe master bedroom serves as a peaceful retreat, complete with a walk-in wardrobe and a beautifully finished ensuite. Three additional bedrooms are complemented by a modern family bathroom featuring a relaxing bathtub, ideal for busy family life.\r\n\r\nAdditional features include:\r\nHeat Pumps\r\nIntercom System\r\nUnderfloor Heating in Bathrooms\r\nPre-Wired EV Charger\r\nDouble Internal-Access Garage\r\n\r\nLocated in a peaceful, family-friendly neighbourhood, the home is conveniently close to local schools, parks, shops, and public transport. Cafés, supermarkets, and scenic walking tracks are all within easy reach. The Northern Motorway connection provides a smooth commute to the city or North Shore, while Orewa's stunning golden beach is just minutes away, offering the ultimate coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nStylish, low-maintenance, and completely move-in ready, this exceptional home presents an exciting opportunity to secure your place in one of the coast's most desirable lifestyle locations.\r\n\r\nContact Team Sabrina today to arrange your private viewing.",
